  "description": "MCP server axon: expone read+write del roadmap v2 a clientes MCP (Claude Code, opencode). TERCER consumer del core (mismo modelo que CLI), sin BFF. Spec MCP 2026-07-28 + SDK v2 dual-era + stdio (local) + HTTP streamable (deploy).",
